# Ai — main endpoints. Generated skeleton, synthetic data only.
# Path ids below are placeholders — replace with real ids from a list call.
@purpose = 1
@version = 1
# Variables: see rest/http-client.env.json (host, session, xsrf). How to get them: docs/guides/api.md
# Full list of Ai operations: /api/docs (tag "Ai").

### GET /api/ai/status — ai.status
GET {{host}}/api/ai/status
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}

### POST /api/ai/test — ai.test
POST {{host}}/api/ai/test
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Referer: {{host}}/

### GET /api/ai/stats — ?period=today|7d|30d
GET {{host}}/api/ai/stats
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}

### GET /api/ai/prompts/{purpose} — ai.prompts.show
GET {{host}}/api/ai/prompts/{{purpose}}
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}

### POST /api/ai/prompts/{purpose} — ai.prompts.save
